{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893760/extras/baf2bb7176ca177edc11fadcfab22b6b.avif?t=1774369891\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893760/extras_big/baf2bb7176ca177edc11fadcfab22b6b.webp?t=1774369891 width=1560 height=261 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893760/extras/77886ad60a13c7d2b080ddbbfa2728fe.poster.avif?t=1774369891\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893760/extras/77886ad60a13c7d2b080ddbbfa2728fe.webm?t=1774369891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893760/extras/77886ad60a13c7d2b080ddbbfa2728fe.mp4?t=1774369891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deploy Golems:</strong> Summon stone, crystal, wood, and other elemental golems, each with unique strengths. Position them strategically to block, smash, and blast the invading goblins. Upgrade them between battles to unlock devastating abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cast Spells:</strong>\u00a0Harness the power of Anvilium to unleash firestorms, freezing winds, and other magical effects. Spells can turn the tide in a tough wave \u2014 wipe out swarms, disable bosses, or buff your golems for maximum impact.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Enemies:</strong>\u00a0Face mischievous goblins, sneaky assassins, lumbering trolls, and bizarre monsters that challenge your strategy. Each enemy has different behaviors \u2014 from fast runners to tanky brutes \u2014 forcing you to adapt every wave.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893760/extras/828d90a1004eaae5a1ecee73baae4deb.avif?t=1774369891\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893760/extras_big/828d90a1004eaae5a1ecee73baae4deb.webp?t=1774369891 width=1560 height=261 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893760/extras/39a8de51b83809406dae3a10473d0a2f.webp?t=1774369891\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893760/extras/39a8de51b83809406dae3a10473d0a2f.poster.avif?t=1774369891\" class=\"bb_img\" width=854 height=480 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anvilium:</strong> The core resource of the realm, used to summon golems, cast spells, and shape your strategy. Manage it wisely \u2014 every decision matters for survival and crazy build potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades:</strong> Enhance your golems and spells. Choose between different upgrades that unlock stronger attacks, special effects, or faster cooldowns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tree:</strong> Progress permanently by investing in a passive skill tree. Unlock overall bonuses that strengthen your defenses across all aspects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relics:</strong> Discover powerful relics that grant huge bonuses \u2014 but always with a twist. Each relic gives you an advantage while adding a drawback, forcing you to adapt your playstyle in unexpected ways.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893760/extras/94ba75a8cf335d462927c81163aa16be.avif?t=1774369891\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893760/extras_big/94ba75a8cf335d462927c81163aa16be.webp?t=1774369891 width=1560 height=261 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893760/extras/e2b27e043d65ca8c1c092b0060ddd3ba.poster.avif?t=1774369891\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893760/extras/e2b27e043d65ca8c1c092b0060ddd3ba.webm?t=1774369891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893760/extras/e2b27e043d65ca8c1c092b0060ddd3ba.mp4?t=1774369891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >L<strong>ightning-fast shuriken-throwing ninja:\u00a0</strong>Transform your golems into rapid-fire assassins that shred through enemy swarms with endless streams of shurikens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unkillable tanks with thorns:\u00a0</strong>Build frontline golems that refuse to fall \u2014 every hit they take bounces back, punishing goblins for daring to attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No golems, all lava floor:\u00a0</strong>Skip the defenders and set the whole battlefield ablaze. Burn waves of monsters with molten terrain as they scramble for safety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meteors shower the size of the whole screen:\u00a0</strong>Rain down catastrophic destruction. When the entire screen fills with meteors, nothing survives.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893760/extras/598225cb6dbe305b6442e3ddfa420bfa.avif?t=1774369891\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893760/extras_big/598225cb6dbe305b6442e3ddfa420bfa.